    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "George Beyond",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102218461901703082802/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIvzf9r6o_n6dc63Lafu4lnbOCVKj6aC9NXGLqZn0WIfvTV8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "The best family and service ever! Very reasonable prices, and they don’t try to break your bank account. Highly recommended. Merci beaucoup! 5*******",
        "time": 1756924230,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Broderick",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107629477546714490815/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLqEKPcP7etWG3rG0cGttojHizxnqkB0oMqyxZ2yslo7tg1Sw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "I paid $108 for an oil change here last fall. About a week before that, I had a full inspection done elsewhere—no issues with the oil pan. After the oil change, my trusted mechanic (who documented it on the receipt) discovered the oil pan had been cracked.\n\nI went back, and they admitted the damage but gave me a used replacement, saying they wouldn’t reimburse me unless they installed it. That pan turned out to be cracked too. I paid $250 out of pocket for a patch job, and I still need a new oil pan.\n\nI tried to resolve this with them directly. They refused to take accountability. I’ve filed a complaint with the BBB. Be careful.",
        "time": 1750104287,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jacqueline Takac",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116314047568354487390/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU5Z0uBJwYC0C1jP-Jq0ZNflwQ2QG5DXhzW1eQCPjBqSzr4cGE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "The owner is friendly however their younger staff not the brightest tool in the shed.They screwed my balancing on my tires and one dropped my rim now I have a dent and had a nerve of blaming me for it what a bunch of idiots. I don't recommend this place.",
        "time": 1730392611,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carol Crockett",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116136531384112844492/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWxEeJxnEhUuT4kl6N7FAbW8KBN0HO02iC0pbIQW-TXxGigGfHG=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Great place. Bought rims and two tires. Service was great. I was fit in and everything thing was done. Two of my winter tires weren't great. I had bought the car with four winters tires. Never used them.Had them taken off as soon as I bought the car. Just to say they showed them to me and said the car would shake a bit if they were put in back. So I bought two new ones. I so appreciate that they informed me and showed me and I feel safer because of them.\nRecommend this place to anyone.",
        "time": 1700875398,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Michael Padilla",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115816887998988195073/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJcm2X3NQOXhc8V4P5bfrTKGMzu-wQ-HUczcKK_rrQuP7N5ig=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Great place for cheap repairs but very muddy and takes a while to be served.\nFound a great hood for a good price though.",
        "time": 1571872176,
        "translated": false
      }
